@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
hide empty description

[*] --> Idle
Idle --> Waiting : start\n(age restarts at 0)
Waiting --> Idle : !start
Waiting --> Running : start && age >= value\n(delay is ok(value))
Running --> Idle : !start
Waiting --> Idle : delay is fault(_)
Running --> Idle : delay is fault(_)

note "Each tick takes at most one transition.\nIf observed_start is a fault, phase keeps its value.\nmotor <- phase' == Running" as N
@enduml
